sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant CLI
    participant App as CompanyIngestionService
    participant Store as EvidenceStore
    participant SEC as SecClient
    participant Ingest as EvidenceIngestionService
    participant Arelle as ArelleProcessor
    participant Map as DirectMappingService

    Operator->>CLI: ingest or scan ticker
    CLI->>Store: schema preflight / explicit upgrade approval
    CLI->>App: ingest_company(ticker, counts, force)
    App->>Store: initialize and get_company_state

    alt Stored window is current and complete
        Store-->>App: current state
        App-->>CLI: reused_local, no SEC or mapping
    else Refresh is due, forced, or incomplete
        App->>SEC: resolve company and discover lineage window
        SEC-->>App: annual and quarterly filings

        loop Each selected filing, sequentially
            App->>Ingest: process filing
            Ingest->>Store: find reusable snapshot by accession and profile
            alt Verified compatible snapshot exists
                Store-->>Ingest: snapshot reference
                Ingest->>Store: mark attempt reused
            else New extraction is required
                Ingest->>Arelle: extract_evidence into attempt staging
                Arelle-->>Ingest: detached FilingEvidenceBundle
                Ingest->>Store: save snapshot plus report-v2 evaluation
                Store-->>Ingest: stored snapshot id
            end
            Ingest-->>App: filing outcome
        end

        App->>Store: publish stronger successful active window
        Store-->>App: current published state

        alt At least one new accession succeeded
            App->>Map: evaluate_company(require_complete_window=false)
            Map->>Store: load exact snapshot/report inputs
            Store-->>Map: candidate facts and prior evaluation identity
            Map->>Store: save or reuse and publish metric evaluation
            Store-->>Map: annual/quarterly result refs
            Map-->>App: mapping result
        else No new successful accession
            Note over App,Map: Mapping is skipped
        end
        App-->>CLI: initialized, updated, no-update, no-filings, or fallback
    end

    CLI-->>Operator: summaries, warnings, paths, and exit code

